        "label": "1(a)(i)",
        "question": "Describe how each of the following might influence the Ryan family when planning the redecoration of their house: environmental factors; family size and circumstances; special needs of family members/friends.",
        "marks": 20,
        "model": "Environmental: use eco-friendly wood/tile floors, solar panels, pipe/cylinder lagging, geothermal heating, CFL/sensor lighting and eco paint. Family: provide living/storage space, home-work area and future play/study/sunroom needs, decorate for age, budget and security. Special needs: wide doors, lowered switches/sockets, easy-close curtains and accessible bathrooms.",
        "diagram": "",
