        "label": "(a)(i)",
        "question": "In an age of austerity, high unemployment and street protests that focus on the harsh\neconomic realities of the present day, there’s a sense that the world of secure\nemployment and jobs with good benefits are a thing of the past.\nDifferentiate between paid work and unpaid work.",
        "marks": 10,
