        "label": "(c)(i)",
        "question": "Explain what is osteoporosis.",
        "marks": 6,
        "model": "2 points @ 3 marks each \nOsteoporosis is a disease which causes the bones to become thin and porous; this results in \nfragile and brittle bones that break easily;",
        "diagram": "",
