        "marks": 15,
        "model": "3 points @ 5 marks each \n\nProvides fresh air for respiration; removes stale air full of impurities and odours; assists combustion \n\ne.g. open fires; controls humidity levels in the air; reduces condensation; controls air temperature; \n\nhelps in the control of respiratory conditions such as asthma, etc. \n\n(ii)",
        "diagram": "",
